{"id": "qwen-json-call", "family": "qwen", "why": "a call in the JSON form, after the reasoning; the answer text is empty", "raw": "I should list the folder first.\n</think>\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"exec\", \"arguments\": {\"command\": \"ls\"}}\n</tool_call><|im_end|>", "calls": [{"name": "exec", "arguments": "{\"command\": \"ls\"}"}], "content": ""}
